みんちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-35596":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"深く深く夢の中に、、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"縷縷夢兎個展『PLAY HOUSE』\nかにょんとりりこと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花音とリリコと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（可愛い空間に縷縷夢兎を着た可愛い女の子沢山いてしあわせだった、、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒宮れいちゃん、来夢ちゃん\n弓ライカちゃん、mizukiちゃん\nが出演してる新作映像3本、\n全部素敵でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れいちゃんと来夢ちゃんは前作よりもちょっと大人に近づいてて美しさ増してました。\nライカちゃんとmizukiちゃんの二人の表現力もすきだな～ライカちゃんの目の強さすきだな～これは何回も見て佳苗さんのこの作品で伝えたいメッセージを読み取りたい...."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"縷縷夢兎を何度か袖に通させてもらっているありがたみ..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な個展、\n今日からはじまってますのでぜひ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は、\n禁断の多数決っていう\nバンドが気になりすぎてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほげちゃん..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ最近で一番グッときた女の子....\nみんなかわいすぎだ～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何してるとき幸せ？？？？\n普段何考えてる？？？\nってメンバーのだれかに最近きかれたけど、\n即答「可愛い子の事を常に考えてるし、可愛い子のことを考えるのが幸せだし、ストレス発散も可愛い子をみること、そして趣味は可愛い子発掘。特に一番の幸せはあのちゃんの写真がアップされたとき。」以上。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それを聞いて一言\n「凄いね。」終了。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいい病。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日発売されました\nまるっと乃木坂のプレイボーイ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなちさんとちはるの\n割とまじで答えにくい\n真剣な相談に答えました(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"偉そうだけど自分置いといて、Pとして！\nキャラとかについて...こんなこと思ってても人に対しては口出さないタイプなので本誌で読んでね～～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴち"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/25/0279225/0014.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-1782":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぽーにぃーてーる～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/images/2012/01/08/himeka0047.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今朝は５時に起きて\n撮影"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/camera.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ってまいりましたひめたんです(`・・)ゝ\nポニーテール。懐かしーい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやーん寂しい帰りたい!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新年迎えるちょっと前からひめたんはホームシックになりつつあります('・ω・`)\nマネージャーという名のぱぱままと、\nメンバーという名のお姉ちゃんがいっぱいおって\n乃木坂ふぁみりーは今日も明日も大好きです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...ほいでもそろそろお家が恋しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恋しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"からここでコメ返！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは、高校生になったら東京に出て来るんだよね？\n東京のここが苦手ってとこある？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうですよー♪\n東京の苦手なとこねーどこだろう...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おみくじの画像は大吉ですけど、\nあれはひめたんではなくてひめたんファミリーってことですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんを含めた中元ふぁみりーってことにしておこっかな(*^^*)\nとかゆーてみる。\n実際大吉引いたのはひめたんの妹かな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔でも今でもいいけど憧れの人っている？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Perfumeセンパイっ(//∀//)♪\n長かったであろう下積みの時代から真面目に努力して\nこんなにビックになった素敵な先輩たち。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか認めてもらえなかったり\n辛い事があった時も\n諦めないで夢を叶えて輝いている"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/shine.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先輩たちがいるから\nひめたん諦めないし頑張れる♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お餅を2分の1個って少なっ！\nダイエットしてるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー最近は食事には気を配るようにしとる(ω)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめにょんって絵うまいの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃは(ω)★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは野球好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これ前に同じ質問あったけど、もう一回？？\nルールとか全然わからんけど、野球少年はかっこいいと思います(*^^*)\nちなみにひめたんに野球をさせたら大変なことになります。\nピッチャーとキャッチャーの違いがわかるレベル。\n('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度広島行った時ひめたんに案内してもらおうかな？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいーよろこんで!\n楽しいコースをプランニングして待っとるけえ、いつでも広島きてね♪\n(∀)わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"},"sba-hinata-20750":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" こんばんは！\n \n けやき坂46の加藤史帆です(・ω・)\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHYE54SKMMYK3YJ0SN89WS6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n 本日11月10日は、、、\n \n 井口眞緒のお誕生日です((o(^∇^)o))\n \n 眞緒ちゃんを初めて見たのは3次審査の待合室で、凄い頻度でお手洗いに行くなぁと思いながら見てました(笑)\n オーディションのSHOWROOM審査を見た時は面白すぎて見ながら星投げてました！\n 最終審査の待合室で偶然にも隣になって、そこからすごく仲良くなって今ではなんでも言える唯一の人です！\n \n だいすき！\n \n 余裕があるときまた小顔矯正通おうね！☆\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHYE6405XK4QCCXDK7ENP5X","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHYE73G3S2W4E78KCR82NEM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n おやすみなさい(・ω・)\n \n 加藤史帆"}],"source":"archive"}}